[{"name":"v0.4.0","uuid":"134154822","tag_name":"v0.4.0","target_commitish":"main","body":"## What's Changed\r\n* misc: bump fiab image version to v0.3.0 by @myungjin in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/452\r\n* feat: FedGFT implementation by @GustavBaumgart in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/453\r\n* misc: update flame bibtex by @myungjin in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/456\r\n* feat: SCAFFOLD implementation by @GustavBaumgart in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/454\r\n* Added dummy UI files and changed Dockerfile by @raresgaia123 in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/457\r\n* Added UI yaml files by @raresgaia123 in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/458\r\n* Added http support for apiserver. by @raresgaia123 in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/460\r\n* Added React app debug logs. by @raresgaia123 in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/459\r\n* feat: handle cors by @myungjin in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/461\r\n* misc: update addlicense file for react app by @myungjin in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/464\r\n* feat: tasklet start time by @GustavBaumgart in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/465\r\n* Replaced dummy react app with dashboard react. by @raresgaia123 in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/463\r\n* fix: clear metrics and tasklet alias by @GustavBaumgart in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/466\r\n* docs: remove MacOS from fiab system documentation by @GustavBaumgart in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/467\r\n* Updated UI files, configmap MLFlow api URL. by @raresgaia123 in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/468\r\n* Updated documentation for Dashboard. by @raresgaia123 in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/469\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @raresgaia123 made their first contribution in https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/pull/457\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/cisco-open/flame/compare/v0.3.0...v0.4.0","draft":false,